        "title": "Security Engineering: Threat, Design, Response - Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Three sibling concerns sit under one design posture (zero trust):\n    DISTRIBUTED SYSTEMS:  \"Who has the truth?\"\n    SECURITY ENGINEERING: \"Who do you trust?\"\n    CLOUD ARCHITECTURE:   \"Where do you put the truth?\"\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#006",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:security-engineering:00-overview, git-history:security-engineering:00-overview]",
